--- !u!114 &839523924
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 839523923}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 5 | \xC7apraz \xC7arp\u0131m"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. Ortada \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m, sa\u011Fda
    \xFC\xE7genin normali, solda sa\u011F sol g\xF6stergesi bulunur. Play tu\u015Funa
    bas\u0131n ve Hedef nesnesini s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Gozcu hedefe k\u0131sa yoldan
    d\xF6ner.\n\n\xDC\xE7 k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \xF6rnekle \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131
    inceliyoruz. Ortadaki \xF6rnekte iki vekt\xF6r\xFCn \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n\u0131
    ok olarak g\xF6r\xFCyoruz. Sa\u011Fdaki \xF6rnekte bir \xFC\xE7genin normalini
    buluyoruz. Soldaki \xF6rnekte bir g\xF6zc\xFCn\xFCn hedefini sa\u011F\u0131nda
    m\u0131 solunda m\u0131 g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC hesapl\u0131yor ve g\xF6zc\xFCy\xFC
    hedefe k\u0131sa yoldan d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders05_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n. Hierarchy'de CaprazOrnegi nesnesini
    se\xE7in ve Scene penceresinde F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131
    ok A, mavi ok B vekt\xF6r\xFCd\xFCr. Ye\u015Fil ok \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131md\u0131r
    ve 0, 4, 0 de\u011Feriyle yukar\u0131 bakar."
  - "UcB nesnesini A vekt\xF6r\xFCne do\u011Fru s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Ye\u015Fil ok k\u0131sal\u0131r.
    UcB konumunu 0, 0, 3 yap\u0131n. \u0130ki vekt\xF6r ayn\u0131 y\xF6ne bakar ve
    \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m s\u0131f\u0131r olur."
  - "UcB konumunu -2, 0, 0 yap\u0131n. Ye\u015Fil ok a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 d\xF6ner
    ve 0, -4, 0 de\u011Ferini al\u0131r. Konumu yeniden 2, 0, 0 yap\u0131n."
  - "NormalOrnegi nesnesini se\xE7in ve F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. \xDC\xE7gen yerde
    yatar ve normali yukar\u0131 bakar. KoseB nesnesinin Position Y de\u011Ferini
    2 yap\u0131n. \xDC\xE7gen e\u011Filir, normal y\xFCzeye dik kal\u0131r."
  - "Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki SagSolGoster beti\u011Fini
    a\xE7\u0131n ve Update fonksiyonunu okuyun. \xC7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n Y
    bile\u015Feninin Rotate fonksiyonuna nas\u0131l verildi\u011Fini bulun."
  - "SagSolOrnegi nesnesini se\xE7in ve F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. SagSolGoster beti\u011Fini
    Gozcu nesnesine ekleyin. Hedef nesnesini beti\u011Fin Hedef alan\u0131na s\xFCr\xFCkleyin.
    Yaz\u0131da \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n Y bile\u015Feni 0.71 ve SA\u011EDA
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "Hedef nesnesini Gozcu nesnesinin soluna s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Y bile\u015Feni eksi
    olur, yaz\u0131 SOLDA der ve ye\u015Fil ok a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 d\xF6ner."
  - "Gozcu nesnesinde Hedefe Don kutusunu i\u015Faretleyin ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n.
    Scene penceresinde Hedef nesnesini s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Gozcu hedefe her zaman k\u0131sa
    yoldan d\xF6ner. Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "UcA ve UcB nesnelerini \xE7apraz \xE7arp\u0131m\u0131n uzunlu\u011Fu 6 olacak
    bi\xE7imde yerle\u015Ftirin. Birden \xE7ok \xE7\xF6z\xFCm var m\u0131?"
  - "NormalOrnegi nesnesinde UcgenNormal bile\u015Feninin B ve C alanlar\u0131ndaki
    nesnelerin yerini de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin. Normal hangi y\xF6ne bak\u0131yor?"
  - "Gozcu nesnesinde Donus Hizi de\u011Ferini 30 ve 360 yaparak Play modunda deneyin."
  - "Hedef nesnesini Gozcu nesnesinin tam arkas\u0131na koyun. Gozcu hangi y\xF6ne
    d\xF6n\xFCyor? Neden?"
